  "If a step shows a retry or waiting message, do not click or refresh — the engine checks transaction status and recovers on its own. Keep the Phantom panel open during a run; Phantom locks itself after about 15 minutes of inactivity.": "Jika sesuatu langkah menunjukkan mesej cuba semula atau menunggu, jangan klik atau muat semula — enjin menyemak status transaksi dan pulih dengan sendirinya. Pastikan panel Phantom terbuka semasa larian; Phantom akan terkunci selepas kira-kira 15 minit tanpa aktiviti.",
