  "— run history saved in the browser, CSV export, and a per-run balance check.": "— sejarah larian disimpan dalam pelayar, eksport CSV dan semakan baki bagi setiap larian.",
  "Creates a test SPL token, mints {0} to your account, and opens an escrow and a recipient account. Two wallet prompts. Needed once before running the flow.": "Mencipta token SPL ujian, mencetak {0} ke akaun anda, dan membuka akaun eskrow serta akaun penerima. Dua gesaan dompet. Diperlukan sekali sebelum menjalankan aliran.",
  "NONE": "TIADA",
