  "Force a step to fail, to demonstrate compensation.": "Paksa satu langkah gagal untuk menunjukkan pampasan.",
  "Flow ID:": "ID Aliran:",
  "Every saved run, with signatures, balances and a balance check. Saved in this browser only and kept after a refresh. Downloads are in English: a text log or a CSV spreadsheet.": "Setiap larian yang disimpan, dengan tandatangan, baki dan semakan baki. Disimpan dalam pelayar ini sahaja dan kekal selepas dimuat semula. Muat turun dalam bahasa Inggeris: log teks atau hamparan CSV.",
  "No Phantom wallet detected. Install the Phantom extension and switch it to Devnet.": "Dompet Phantom tidak dikesan. Pasang sambungan Phantom dan tukar ke Devnet.",
  "Wallet connected. Make sure Phantom is set to Devnet.": "Dompet disambungkan. Pastikan Phantom ditetapkan kepada Devnet.",
