  "Creating token and accounts — the wallet will prompt twice…": "Mencipta token dan akaun — dompet akan meminta kelulusan dua kali…",
  "Not enough Devnet SOL for setup. Request more at faucet.solana.com (setup needs about 0.02 SOL).": "SOL Devnet tidak mencukupi untuk persediaan. Minta lebih di faucet.solana.com (persediaan memerlukan kira-kira 0.02 SOL).",
  "Setup complete. {0} test tokens minted to your account.": "Persediaan selesai. {0} token ujian telah dicetak ke akaun anda.",
  "Setup failed:": "Persediaan gagal:",
  "Running…": "Sedang berjalan…",
  "Not enough Devnet SOL for fees. Request more at faucet.solana.com and try again.": "SOL Devnet tidak mencukupi untuk yuran. Minta lebih di faucet.solana.com dan cuba lagi.",
  "Your token account holds {0}, and this flow moves {1}. Run SETUP again to mint a fresh allocation.": "Akaun token anda memegang {0}, dan aliran ini memindahkan {1}. Jalankan PERSEDIAAN semula untuk mencetak peruntukan baharu.",
  "All three steps completed. Every transaction is verifiable on Solscan.": "Ketiga-tiga langkah selesai. Setiap transaksi boleh disahkan di Solscan.",
  "A step failed. Completed steps were compensated automatically — each compensation is a real on-chain transaction.": "Satu langkah gagal. Langkah yang telah selesai dipampas secara automatik — setiap pampasan ialah transaksi on-chain sebenar.",
  "A step failed and compensation did not complete. Manual intervention required.": "Satu langkah gagal dan pampasan tidak selesai. Campur tangan manual diperlukan.",
  "Unexpected error:": "Ralat tidak dijangka:",
  "TOKEN ACCOUNTS": "AKAUN TOKEN",
  "Real SPL token accounts on Solana devnet. Balances update after every run. Each flow moves {0} tokens.": "Akaun token SPL sebenar di Solana devnet. Baki dikemas kini selepas setiap larian. Setiap aliran memindahkan {0} token.",
