  "PAY": "BAYAR",
  "Generate a payment order in three steps: choose the service and amount, choose how you want to pay, and get the exact payment details with your order number.": "Jana pesanan pembayaran dalam tiga langkah: pilih perkhidmatan dan jumlah, pilih cara anda mahu membayar, dan dapatkan butiran pembayaran yang tepat bersama nombor pesanan anda.",
