  "Currency": "Mata wang",
  "Deposit and milestone percentages are set in your written agreement — use the split that matches your quote.": "Peratusan deposit dan pencapaian ditetapkan dalam perjanjian bertulis anda — gunakan pembahagian yang sepadan dengan sebut harga anda.",
  "Customer service (optional)": "Khidmat pelanggan (pilihan)",
  "If one of our customer service staff assisted you, type their name here so we can credit them.": "Jika salah seorang kakitangan khidmat pelanggan kami membantu anda, taipkan nama mereka di sini supaya kami dapat memberikan pengiktirafan kepada mereka.",
